{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.arenas_are_distinct","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.arenas_are_distinct","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L172-L173","doc":"The two arenas are distinguished by an invariant of the total space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_bundle_b1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_bundle_b1","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L170-L170","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.reeb_bundle_b1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.reeb_bundle_b1","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L168-L168","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.not_sphere_of_descartes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.not_sphere_of_descartes","kind":"theorem","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L145-L156","doc":"**The exclusion.**  The QOU contact manifold — the unit circle bundle over\nBring's surface, whose Euler characteristic the Descartes condition fixes at\n`−6` — is not `S³`.\n\nThe invariant is the **first Betti number**: `8` against `0`.  This is a\nstructural exclusion, not a scope-limited negative; it holds for every Euler\nnumber and so for every circle bundle over that base. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_forces_b1_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_forces_b1_pos","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L132-L143","doc":"**The theorem.**  A circle bundle over a base of Euler characteristic `−6`\nhas total space with first Betti number at least `8`, *whatever* its Euler\nnumber.  No hypothesis on `e` is needed: the `e = 0` branch only makes `b₁`\nlarger. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.base_euler_eq_two_of_totalB1_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.base_euler_eq_two_of_totalB1_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L124-L128","doc":"Restated through the Euler characteristic: a `b₁ = 0` total space forces\n`χ(base) = 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.base_sphere_of_totalB1_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.base_sphere_of_totalB1_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L114-L122","doc":"A circle bundle whose total space has `b₁ = 0` must sit over a sphere, and\nits Euler number must be nonzero.  Both branches of the Gysin count are used:\n`e ≠ 0` forces `2g = 0`, and `e = 0` forces the impossible `2g + 1 = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_not_sphere_base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.descartes_not_sphere_base","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L109-L110","doc":"The Descartes base is not a sphere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.genus_eq_four_of_descartes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.genus_eq_four_of_descartes","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L104-L107","doc":"The Descartes condition `χ = −6` pins the genus to `4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.surfaceEuler_eq_two_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.surfaceEuler_eq_two_iff","kind":"theorem","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L99-L102","doc":"`χ = 2` characterises the sphere. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.genus_injective_of_surfaceEuler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.genus_injective_of_surfaceEuler","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L93-L97","doc":"The Euler characteristic determines the genus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.sphereB1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.sphereB1","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L87-L89","doc":"First Betti number of `S³`.  Recorded as a definition so the statements\nbelow read as comparisons of invariants rather than as arithmetic on `0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.totalB1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.totalB1","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L80-L85","doc":"First Betti number of the total space of an oriented circle bundle over a\nclosed orientable surface of genus `g` with Euler number `e`.\n\n**This is the model** — the Gysin count, cited not derived; see the module\ndocstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.surfaceEuler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.CircleBundleBettiObstruction.surfaceEuler","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/CircleBundleBettiObstruction.lean#L77-L78","doc":"Euler characteristic of a closed orientable surface of genus `g`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}